# Forbidden patterns for outbound content. Used by .claude/hooks/check-names.sh.
# One regex per line. Case-insensitive. Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# Examples (uncomment and customize):
# Coimbra-Prado        # someone keeps misspelling your last name
# Giovanni             # single 'n' is correct; double 'n' is a recurring typo
# Granola              # if you use krisp.ai and want to avoid claiming the other tool
